WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.2 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Organisational structures and organigrams

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your chart shows who reports to whom, and should fit your stage.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Show governance separately from day-to-day management.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Use role names; dotted lines for volunteers and contractors.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Add lead roles before one person becomes a bottleneck.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: trustees oversee the director; four leads report to him; the shop sits in a company the charity owns.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a map of roles and reporting lines.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
